(5549130, 802818, 101707, '<td valign="top">This is a different interpretation as to the meaning of grain. I don''t think that this is what the challenge is all about. Pretty photo though.</td>', 'This is a different interpretation as to the meaning of grain. I don''t think that this is what the challenge is all about. Pretty photo though.', '2009-06-29 01:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
