(5549148, 802632, 101707, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. The grain adds a texture to the mushroom reminding me of the hills of the Southwest.</td>', 'Excellent idea. The grain adds a texture to the mushroom reminding me of the hills of the Southwest.', '2009-06-29 01:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
