(5549157, 802627, 62727, '<td valign="top">This is a great image!  The grain really compliments it.  The only thing I might change is to have a tighter crop so you can''t see the ground and it looks like the plane is really flying. 8</td>', 'This is a great image!  The grain really compliments it.  The only thing I might change is to have a tighter crop so you can''t see the ground and it looks like the plane is really flying. 8', '2009-06-29 01:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
