(5549182, 802617, 100773, '<td valign="top">I think this photo would be <u>overall</u> better had the center of focus been the center of the daisy. Apart from that, your use of grain is quite beautifull!</td>', 'I think this photo would be overall better had the center of focus been the center of the daisy. Apart from that, your use of grain is quite beautifull!', '2009-06-29 01:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549188, 802427, 62727, '<td valign="top">Nice!  I really like your post processing. 8</td>', 'Nice!  I really like your post processing. 8', '2009-06-29 01:19:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549193, 802377, 101707, '<td valign="top">This sure fits the challenge. I can feel the particles suspended in the water. Good job</td>', 'This sure fits the challenge. I can feel the particles suspended in the water. Good job', '2009-06-29 01:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549194, 802746, 62727, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Perfect use of grain. 8</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Perfect use of grain. 8', '2009-06-29 01:21:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549200, 802721, 100773, '<td valign="top">Personally I don''t think grain adds anything special to this picture. Your angle and idea is good, but that''s about it. Sorry!</td>', 'Personally I don''t think grain adds anything special to this picture. Your angle and idea is good, but that''s about it. Sorry!', '2009-06-29 01:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549203, 802818, 62727, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and just the right amount of grain. 8</td>', 'Nice lighting and just the right amount of grain. 8', '2009-06-29 01:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549207, 801227, 62727, '<td valign="top">I really like this!  Your use of sepia tone and grain is just right. 8</td>', 'I really like this!  Your use of sepia tone and grain is just right. 8', '2009-06-29 01:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549216, 802744, 62727, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  8</td>', 'Beautiful!  8', '2009-06-29 01:28:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549231, 802427, 100773, '<td valign="top">First of all let me say that this is a very good photo! Angle, composition and the "dull" colors are all great! And I find your use of grain intereseting as well. At first, I did notice that there were some grain there, but not really visible (except from the dark areas), but that''s some of the beauty I find in this photo. Grain really adds something special to this photo, and maybe it would''ve been hard to see the "grain "had this been another challenge. But had you removed all the grain, I guess this would be a completely different photo. Great balance is what I''m trying to say at 06:30am!</td>', 'First of all let me say that this is a very good photo! Angle, composition and the "dull" colors are all great! And I find your use of grain intereseting as well. At first, I did notice that there were some grain there, but not really visible (except from the dark areas), but that''s some of the beauty I find in this photo. Grain really adds something special to this photo, and maybe it would''ve been hard to see the "grain "had this been another challenge. But had you removed all the grain, I guess this would be a completely different photo. Great balance is what I''m trying to say at 06:30am!', '2009-06-29 01:33:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549235, 802360, 86447, '<td valign="top">They ARE well travelled!  They''ve travelled from one challenge to another really quickly!  <br/> <br/>[thumb]801994[/thumb]    I like the texture of them here... but like the other shot better.   (not voting)</td>', 'They ARE well travelled!  They''ve travelled from one challenge to another really quickly!   [thumb]801994[/thumb]    I like the texture of them here... but like the other shot better.   (not voting)', '2009-06-29 01:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549260, 802744, 100773, '<td valign="top">It''s an extremely beautifull photo, but I don''t think grain adds that much to this photo. You see some in the background and on the mane, but the rest sort of blends in with the colors of the horse. But still, the photo itselft is extremely beautifull. I just wish there had been done more.</td>', 'It''s an extremely beautifull photo, but I don''t think grain adds that much to this photo. You see some in the background and on the mane, but the rest sort of blends in with the colors of the horse. But still, the photo itselft is extremely beautifull. I just wish there had been done more.', '2009-06-29 01:48:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549261, 802758, 100773, '<td valign="top">There''s grain all right, but I think the lighting in her face is to strong to give an overall grainy feeling. Lighting is perfect for other types of pictures, but the grain doesn''t add anything special or dominate this photo (which is a very good one, if I may add!).</td>', 'There''s grain all right, but I think the lighting in her face is to strong to give an overall grainy feeling. Lighting is perfect for other types of pictures, but the grain doesn''t add anything special or dominate this photo (which is a very good one, if I may add!).', '2009-06-29 01:48:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549264, 802884, 100773, '<td valign="top">My firs "wow" so far. Don''t know what else to say!</td>', 'My firs "wow" so far. Don''t know what else to say!', '2009-06-29 01:49:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549265, 802821, 31637, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, more artistically than technically since the focus appears off in some areas, or perhaps from an over-use of levels maybe. I love the natural bordering with the buildings.</td>', 'Excellent shot, more artistically than technically since the focus appears off in some areas, or perhaps from an over-use of levels maybe. I love the natural bordering with the buildings.', '2009-06-29 01:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
