(5549328, 802518, 44877, '<td valign="top">This has no grain at all - at least not that I can see. It''s a darling photo and I sure hope the cat is not actually in a cage. No vote.</td>', 'This has no grain at all - at least not that I can see. It''s a darling photo and I sure hope the cat is not actually in a cage. No vote.', '2009-06-29 02:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549331, 802222, 103032, '<td valign="top">Ya, this works.  Grain works in this "modern" image to convey the grittiness of the job.  Good composition, good crop.  My only critique is I wish the reflection in the safety glasses wasn''t there so the viewer can see his eyes.  Other than that, this is well done.</td>', 'Ya, this works.  Grain works in this "modern" image to convey the grittiness of the job.  Good composition, good crop.  My only critique is I wish the reflection in the safety glasses wasn''t there so the viewer can see his eyes.  Other than that, this is well done.', '2009-06-29 02:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549335, 802661, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, composition is okay.  I think this would have been stronger B&amp;W. Just honest opinion.</td>', 'I like the subject, composition is okay.  I think this would have been stronger B&W. Just honest opinion.', '2009-06-29 02:43:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549339, 802879, 63812, '<td valign="top">composition, lights and colours are beautiful. Maybe a little tilted, but nice picture</td>', 'composition, lights and colours are beautiful. Maybe a little tilted, but nice picture', '2009-06-29 02:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549340, 802566, 103032, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and subject but it''s a little too much grain.  Good attempt.</td>', 'I like the composition and subject but it''s a little too much grain.  Good attempt.', '2009-06-29 02:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549341, 802614, 103032, '<td valign="top">Use of grain adds to this image.  The environment is gritty and the graininess enhances that.  Nice job.</td>', 'Use of grain adds to this image.  The environment is gritty and the graininess enhances that.  Nice job.', '2009-06-29 02:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549342, 802668, 103032, '<td valign="top">I think going B&amp;W would have added to the image.  just my opinion.</td>', 'I think going B&W would have added to the image.  just my opinion.', '2009-06-29 02:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549347, 802340, 103032, '<td valign="top">Nice, modern day Norman Rockwellian.  Nice image.</td>', 'Nice, modern day Norman Rockwellian.  Nice image.', '2009-06-29 03:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549371, 802381, 83773, '<td valign="top">Love this!</td>', 'Love this!', '2009-06-29 04:01:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549373, 802569, 83773, '<td valign="top">Very pretty...  very Ansel Adams</td>', 'Very pretty...  very Ansel Adams', '2009-06-29 04:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549382, 801869, 44825, '<td valign="top">Your waterline isn''t level and IMO that throws the picture ''off''.<br/> <br/>Nice capture and good use of grain</td>', 'Your waterline isn''t level and IMO that throws the picture ''off''. Nice capture and good use of grain', '2009-06-29 04:43:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549406, 801728, 101117, '<td valign="top">Nice enough picture, but firstly I don''t see the grain, and secondly, even if there was grain, it''s certainly not the sort of shot that I think would benefit from it.<br/> <br/>I can only assume you are referring to the speckles in the background, but that isn''t film grain as the challenge intended.</td>', 'Nice enough picture, but firstly I don''t see the grain, and secondly, even if there was grain, it''s certainly not the sort of shot that I think would benefit from it. I can only assume you are referring to the speckles in the background, but that isn''t film grain as the challenge intended.', '2009-06-29 05:36:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549407, 802513, 101117, '<td valign="top">This has the perfect drama for the "added gain" type shot. I''m afraid I don''t get the title, possibly I''m missing something but you have have done a great job of telling one story at least.</td>', 'This has the perfect drama for the "added gain" type shot. I''m afraid I don''t get the title, possibly I''m missing something but you have have done a great job of telling one story at least.', '2009-06-29 05:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549409, 802299, 101117, '<td valign="top">Shot feels a bit tight for me, like you''ve cropped a small part out of a much larger shot. The grain works towards the drama in the sky, but the sky itself looks a little fake, perhaps a touch overdone?</td>', 'Shot feels a bit tight for me, like you''ve cropped a small part out of a much larger shot. The grain works towards the drama in the sky, but the sky itself looks a little fake, perhaps a touch overdone?', '2009-06-29 05:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549412, 801822, 101117, '<td valign="top">This is the sort of shot where I don''t think grain works at all. Flowers for me should be clear and crisp with vivid colours.</td>', 'This is the sort of shot where I don''t think grain works at all. Flowers for me should be clear and crisp with vivid colours.', '2009-06-29 05:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549413, 802523, 101117, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of grain here to add drama to an already dramatic shot. I love the detail and the force of the photo, it''s the sort of shot that almost wants to make me take a step back from it!<br/> <br/>I don''t know whether it would be better with or without the rider included, but because I can see a small part of the rider, it does want to make me see more.</td>', 'Excellent use of grain here to add drama to an already dramatic shot. I love the detail and the force of the photo, it''s the sort of shot that almost wants to make me take a step back from it! I don''t know whether it would be better with or without the rider included, but because I can see a small part of the rider, it does want to make me see more.', '2009-06-29 05:42:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(5549459, 802586, 107032, '<td valign="top">77</td>', '77', '2009-06-29 08:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
