(5549586, 802734, 14867, '<td valign="top">Not sure this was a good subject for the challenge. This kind of graphic subject must be as sharp and clear as possible in my opinion. The grain is working against your image here. But the composition is excellent.</td>', 'Not sure this was a good subject for the challenge. This kind of graphic subject must be as sharp and clear as possible in my opinion. The grain is working against your image here. But the composition is excellent.', '2009-06-29 11:26:09.000000', NULL, 1),
