(5554859, 802590, 83313, '<td valign="top">The affordable choice for saying "I love you, but I am also a cheapskate".</td>', 'The affordable choice for saying "I love you, but I am also a cheapskate".', '2009-07-01 22:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554861, 801890, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice dash of color.</td>', 'Nice dash of color.', '2009-07-01 22:53:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554935, 802898, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, though the grain comes off to me a bit more as chrominance noise than image enhancing grain. Not that it matters to me where the grain comes from, simply that it enhances the image. I popped this into my photo editor and it looked good with the same treatment I used with my own entry.</td>', 'I like the shot, though the grain comes off to me a bit more as chrominance noise than image enhancing grain. Not that it matters to me where the grain comes from, simply that it enhances the image. I popped this into my photo editor and it looked good with the same treatment I used with my own entry.', '2009-07-01 23:21:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554939, 802727, 83313, '<td valign="top">Not sure if I should count this as grain or not, but it''s different and I like the effect.</td>', 'Not sure if I should count this as grain or not, but it''s different and I like the effect.', '2009-07-01 23:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554940, 802762, 83313, '<td valign="top">The grain is very subtle here. I like the look, though. I''m wondering if this was done with Nik Silver Efex.</td>', 'The grain is very subtle here. I like the look, though. I''m wondering if this was done with Nik Silver Efex.', '2009-07-01 23:25:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554950, 802877, 83313, '<td valign="top">At first glance this comes off as a snapshot and a quick 4, but the more I look at it, the more I realize that the components of this just work well together. Leads the eye nicely, interesting, but not overpowering textures, and good tonality on the b/w conversion. Actually it comes off to me similarly to my own recent "construction" entry, thought the subjects are totally different.</td>', 'At first glance this comes off as a snapshot and a quick 4, but the more I look at it, the more I realize that the components of this just work well together. Leads the eye nicely, interesting, but not overpowering textures, and good tonality on the b/w conversion. Actually it comes off to me similarly to my own recent "construction" entry, thought the subjects are totally different.', '2009-07-01 23:29:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554952, 801728, 83313, '<td valign="top">Very nice, but where is the grain?</td>', 'Very nice, but where is the grain?', '2009-07-01 23:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554959, 802780, 83313, '<td valign="top">Gruesome and disturbing. I think that was what you were after, so that would make this a success.</td>', 'Gruesome and disturbing. I think that was what you were after, so that would make this a success.', '2009-07-01 23:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554977, 802495, 83313, '<td valign="top">Speaks volumes. I''m not even sure where to begin with a comment. <br/> <br/>I''m not sure if this was staged, or you actually caught this boy being picked on for real, but it speaks more to me than most other images I have seen on DPC. I was raised Jewish and never got picked on for it, but I grew up in a largely Jewish area of Long Island. I was the kid that got picked on for everything else, however, and I have never forgotten the experience. <br/> <br/>Since there is no vote of 20, I will have to give this a 10 and a fave.</td>', 'Speaks volumes. I''m not even sure where to begin with a comment.  I''m not sure if this was staged, or you actually caught this boy being picked on for real, but it speaks more to me than most other images I have seen on DPC. I was raised Jewish and never got picked on for it, but I grew up in a largely Jewish area of Long Island. I was the kid that got picked on for everything else, however, and I have never forgotten the experience.  Since there is no vote of 20, I will have to give this a 10 and a fave.', '2009-07-01 23:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(5554986, 802649, 83313, '<td valign="top">This just isn''t working for me. To me, it seems that the grain is not really doing anything for this image other than taking away detail.</td>', 'This just isn''t working for me. To me, it seems that the grain is not really doing anything for this image other than taking away detail.', '2009-07-01 23:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
