(5559811, 802513, 50695, '<td valign="top">Phenomenal. The sense of pespective is earth-shattering, with your fragile subject at the hinge of chaos.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Red Ribbon<br/> <br/><img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/redpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Phenomenal. The sense of pespective is earth-shattering, with your fragile subject at the hinge of chaos. Posthumous Red Ribbon ', '2009-07-05 01:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559814, 802565, 50695, '<td valign="top">One day Kandinsky grew an eye. He said his paintings had enough of being seen. They want to see. By the way, I see watercolors here and nice pencil work.</td>', 'One day Kandinsky grew an eye. He said his paintings had enough of being seen. They want to see. By the way, I see watercolors here and nice pencil work.', '2009-07-05 01:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(5559816, 801906, 50695, '<td valign="top">Visionary... real and flat ... Buster Keaton is hiding in that boat from Keystone Kops who will never come. The boat is resting. The photo is resting. This is good, because my eyes are tired of being told what to do. Sometimes you have to say to a boat that you just don''t want to go anywhere. Some of us enjoy the threshold between land and water. We don''t want to shove off. We like it here.<br/> <br/>Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. <img alt="'' . substr(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', strrpos(''//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//blackyak.com/dpc/yellowpost.jpg"/></td>', 'Visionary... real and flat ... Buster Keaton is hiding in that boat from Keystone Kops who will never come. The boat is resting. The photo is resting. This is good, because my eyes are tired of being told what to do. Sometimes you have to say to a boat that you just don''t want to go anywhere. Some of us enjoy the threshold between land and water. We don''t want to shove off. We like it here. Posthumous Yellow Ribbon. ', '2009-07-05 01:31:35.000000', NULL, 1),
