(5560657, 802788, 67697, '<td valign="top">I love this one - the gaze is captivating.  There was something that seemed a bit off for me as far as believing this might be a farmer and I think I figured it out.  The ones that I know I don''t think would wear their shirt buttoned up all the way LOL.  They are way too relaxed for that.  Anywho, hope this finishes well - it''s great!</td>', 'I love this one - the gaze is captivating.  There was something that seemed a bit off for me as far as believing this might be a farmer and I think I figured it out.  The ones that I know I don''t think would wear their shirt buttoned up all the way LOL.  They are way too relaxed for that.  Anywho, hope this finishes well - it''s great!', '2009-07-05 18:15:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560660, 802230, 67697, '<td valign="top">I''ve seen quite a few of your SP''s and I have to say that this one is pretty cool.  The grain really enhances the spookiness of the the scene.  Looks quite scary!  Hope this finishes well for you.  Good luck!</td>', 'I''ve seen quite a few of your SP''s and I have to say that this one is pretty cool.  The grain really enhances the spookiness of the the scene.  Looks quite scary!  Hope this finishes well for you.  Good luck!', '2009-07-05 18:17:01.000000', NULL, 1),
