(5560715, 802834, 56452, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I think you went to too much trouble for too little return.   The grain effect is barely discernible.  The petals beside the center of the flower are sufficient without the writing to convey the message.</td>', 'Sorry, I think you went to too much trouble for too little return.   The grain effect is barely discernible.  The petals beside the center of the flower are sufficient without the writing to convey the message.', '2009-07-05 19:24:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560718, 802625, 56452, '<td valign="top">I think this is a great photo.  But you missed the boat just a little.   Convert to black and white for a really striking image, especially with the halo of her hair around her. B/W would probably really make the image pop.</td>', 'I think this is a great photo.  But you missed the boat just a little.   Convert to black and white for a really striking image, especially with the halo of her hair around her. B/W would probably really make the image pop.', '2009-07-05 19:27:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560721, 802656, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, but where''s the grain? It seems to be evident only in the hooves of the horse and that could be explained by the motion.  Fairly dynamic as is, but the composition could improve by off centering the girl a bit more.</td>', 'Nice pic, but where''s the grain? It seems to be evident only in the hooves of the horse and that could be explained by the motion.  Fairly dynamic as is, but the composition could improve by off centering the girl a bit more.', '2009-07-05 19:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560725, 802745, 56452, '<td valign="top">Needs a little more grain effect.   That said,  I really like this with the old bulldozer and the mist in the background.  How long did you have to wait for the light to be right?  Perhaps a little more depth of field is all I would want to change.</td>', 'Needs a little more grain effect.   That said,  I really like this with the old bulldozer and the mist in the background.  How long did you have to wait for the light to be right?  Perhaps a little more depth of field is all I would want to change.', '2009-07-05 19:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560730, 802617, 56452, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.   Great composition and good job on the grain effect.   Simple and uncluttered, easy to appreciate.</td>', 'Nicely done.   Great composition and good job on the grain effect.   Simple and uncluttered, easy to appreciate.', '2009-07-05 19:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560733, 802746, 56452, '<td valign="top">Wow,  right out of an old movie.   You can almost see the red line following the plane across the map.   Grain effect is well done,   looks almost like it was printed on canvas.    great job.</td>', 'Wow,  right out of an old movie.   You can almost see the red line following the plane across the map.   Grain effect is well done,   looks almost like it was printed on canvas.    great job.', '2009-07-05 19:34:24.000000', NULL, 1),
