(5560929, 802495, 62727, '<td valign="top">This image is sad and disturbing, yet powerful. I truly hope this young man is okay.  I really don''t know what else to say.<br/> <br/>I''m back because I can''t stop thinking about this image.  I originally gave you a 7 but I''m bumping it up to a 9.  You captured so much emotion and feeling with this.  I''m very curious about the story behind this photo.</td>', 'This image is sad and disturbing, yet powerful. I truly hope this young man is okay.  I really don''t know what else to say. I''m back because I can''t stop thinking about this image.  I originally gave you a 7 but I''m bumping it up to a 9.  You captured so much emotion and feeling with this.  I''m very curious about the story behind this photo.', '2009-07-05 22:50:19.000000', NULL, 1),
