(5560949, 802718, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the starburst sun.  Beautiful scene - especially with the morning fog in the background.</td>', 'I like the starburst sun.  Beautiful scene - especially with the morning fog in the background.', '2009-07-05 23:06:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560955, 802668, 69246, '<td valign="top">Norman? (Rockwell) is that you? Can it be? The details in this photo are perfect. The natural grain of the door, the cowboy hat, the shirtless child, the look off to one direction, the jeans, and the willow tail (?) and finally the placement of his fingers within. The only drawback is that I wish the barn doors were a little more parallel to the image sides. Perhaps you were at a difficult angle and my guess is the child would have been turned a bit. Never-the-less, a fantastic photo and truly one that completely fits this challenge!</td>', 'Norman? (Rockwell) is that you? Can it be? The details in this photo are perfect. The natural grain of the door, the cowboy hat, the shirtless child, the look off to one direction, the jeans, and the willow tail (?) and finally the placement of his fingers within. The only drawback is that I wish the barn doors were a little more parallel to the image sides. Perhaps you were at a difficult angle and my guess is the child would have been turned a bit. Never-the-less, a fantastic photo and truly one that completely fits this challenge!', '2009-07-05 23:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(5560958, 802713, 67697, '<td valign="top">No snifter or side glass of water?  Looks like a shot instead :)  Love the golden tones and the bokeh.  (ahh I had to go look it up - memory does not serve me well.  i was a bartender once a loooong time ago in a foo foo restaurant.  now I see it can be served this way lol)</td>', 'No snifter or side glass of water?  Looks like a shot instead :)  Love the golden tones and the bokeh.  (ahh I had to go look it up - memory does not serve me well.  i was a bartender once a loooong time ago in a foo foo restaurant.  now I see it can be served this way lol)', '2009-07-05 23:12:36.000000', NULL, 1),
