(5568272, 802722, 51269, '<td valign="top">I love this , Deb- well done !</td>', 'I love this , Deb- well done !', '2009-07-10 18:39:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(5568790, 802495, 68504, '<td valign="top">This photo needs no title, at least in the way I like to look at it.  At first glance it might be posed: the grasping fist is iconic, and the boy''s lips are full and dark as a lipsticked girl''s and I am led to think a bit of lipstick got smudged on the cheek.  But the expression goes beyond everything: something is happening way beyond the boy''s experience/expectation even as he tries to keep his sidelocks out of his face.  Where will he go from here, what will he think?</td>', 'This photo needs no title, at least in the way I like to look at it.  At first glance it might be posed: the grasping fist is iconic, and the boy''s lips are full and dark as a lipsticked girl''s and I am led to think a bit of lipstick got smudged on the cheek.  But the expression goes beyond everything: something is happening way beyond the boy''s experience/expectation even as he tries to keep his sidelocks out of his face.  Where will he go from here, what will he think?', '2009-07-11 15:49:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(5568825, 802495, 7778, '<td valign="top">As some of the comments seem to indicate, the low scores likely came from voters who found the photo unsettling. It''s ironic that what amounts to the very gist and pith of an emotionally charged image often also inspires fears. When this happens, an attempt to diminish it by scoring it low, should probably be interpreted as a desire to diminish the fear it conjured in those afflicted.</td>', 'As some of the comments seem to indicate, the low scores likely came from voters who found the photo unsettling. It''s ironic that what amounts to the very gist and pith of an emotionally charged image often also inspires fears. When this happens, an attempt to diminish it by scoring it low, should probably be interpreted as a desire to diminish the fear it conjured in those afflicted.', '2009-07-11 17:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(5568911, 802427, 24454, '<td valign="top">Just now coming back Jeb to see your amazing grain entry!  I''m so proud of you for winning the blue ribbon with this amazing art piece!  Bravo, Buddy<br/> <br/>P.S.  Did you notice the absence of the bright pink horrid bar highlighting my traumatized blue ribbon bird ??   :)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Just now coming back Jeb to see your amazing grain entry!  I''m so proud of you for winning the blue ribbon with this amazing art piece!  Bravo, Buddy P.S.  Did you notice the absence of the bright pink horrid bar highlighting my traumatized blue ribbon bird ??   :) ', '2009-07-11 21:24:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(5569150, 802222, 106085, '<td valign="top">holy crap!  i can''t believe it...  i certainly didn''t expect to see an image from home.  i''m living in australia now but i''m from allentown!  thanks for a little window from a-town.</td>', 'holy crap!  i can''t believe it...  i certainly didn''t expect to see an image from home.  i''m living in australia now but i''m from allentown!  thanks for a little window from a-town.', '2009-07-12 09:09:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(5569221, 802230, 16912, '<td valign="top">Whoot! I was on holiday from the Thursday during voting and whilst I had high hopes of a good score a Yellow was still out of the blue - many thanks to all the voters!<br/> <br/>A few comments and pm''s have asked how I shot this, it really was quite simple, and here is the original...<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=806559" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/16912/120/806559.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/16912/120/806559.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/15000-19999/16912/120/806559.jpg"/></a> <br/> <br/>I should finish on a high so time for a break from entering sp''s I think ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-07-12 10:59:10.</i></td>', 'Whoot! I was on holiday from the Thursday during voting and whilst I had high hopes of a good score a Yellow was still out of the blue - many thanks to all the voters! A few comments and pm''s have asked how I shot this, it really was quite simple, and here is the original...   I should finish on a high so time for a break from entering sp''s I think ;)', '2009-07-12 11:47:57.000000', '2009-07-12 11:59:10.000000', 0),
